// Tag component granted by an upgrade (Heroes/Pixie's HotFuseSkillAction, rank 3 - see
// PixieHotFuseCharge.qtn) - while present on a projectile's owner, ProjectileHitData.ShouldDetonate
// detonates on a direct enemy hit regardless of the authored DetonateOnEnemyHit value. Deliberately
// scoped to enemy hits only - a ground/geometry contact is unaffected, so a fused bomb (see
// AreaHitData.PlantedFuseTime) still lands and runs its own fuse/taunt behavior (e.g. Birthday Cake)
// normally; this only ever short-circuits straight to detonation on hitting an enemy directly.
// No fields: presence is the signal.
component InstantDetonate
{
}
